{"id":"c3290c020cc313bd","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-random-walk-mixing.md","title":"游走的谱收缩与统计混合","display":"thm-random-walk-mixing — 游走的谱收缩与统计混合","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-random-walk-mixing","aliases":["28-thm-random-walk-mixing"],"display":"thm-random-walk-mixing — 游走的谱收缩与统计混合","depends_on":["[[28-df-spectral-expander]]"],"source_book_location":"Lemma 21.3 and its proof; printed p.424; PDF p.450","source_printed_pages":"424","source_pdf_pages":"450","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","proof_status":"local-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-random-walk-mixing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-random-walk-mixing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-random-walk-mixing — 游走的谱收缩与统计混合"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"df14955ee1f08cd3\" href=\"?note=df14955ee1f08cd3\" title=\"28-df-spectral-expander\">28-df-spectral-expander</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Lemma 21.3 and its proof; printed p.424; PDF p.450"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"424"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"450"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\">\\(G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_G,u_N,\\lambda(G)\">\\(P_G,u_N,\\lambda(G)\\)</span> 与范数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"df14955ee1f08cd3\" href=\"?note=df14955ee1f08cd3\" title=\"28-df-spectral-expander\">28-df-spectral-expander</a> 及其上游。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in[0,1]^N\">\\(p\\in[0,1]^N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_vp(v)=1\">\\(\\sum_vp(v)=1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(t\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_t=P_G^tp\">\\(p_t=P_G^tp\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_G^0=I_N\">\\(P_G^0=I_N\\)</span>，并约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(G)^0=1\">\\(\\lambda(G)^0=1\\)</span>。所有向量均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[N]\">\\([N]\\)</span> 上的列向量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p_t\\in[0,1]^N,\\qquad\\sum_{v=1}^Np_t(v)=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p_t\\in[0,1]^N,\\qquad\\sum_{v=1}^Np_t(v)=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\|p_t-u_N\\|_{2,N}\\le\\lambda(G)^t\\|p-u_N\\|_{2,N}\\le\\lambda(G)^t\\sqrt{1-N^{-1}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\|p_t-u_N\\|_{2,N}\\le\\lambda(G)^t\\|p-u_N\\|_{2,N}\\le\\lambda(G)^t\\sqrt{1-N^{-1}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac12\\sum_{v=1}^N|p_t(v)-N^{-1}|\\le\\frac{\\sqrt N}{2}\\lambda(G)^t\\|p-u_N\\|_{2,N}\\le\\frac12\\lambda(G)^t\\sqrt{N-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac12\\sum_{v=1}^N|p_t(v)-N^{-1}|\\le\\frac{\\sqrt N}{2}\\lambda(G)^t\\|p-u_N\\|_{2,N}\\le\\frac12\\lambda(G)^t\\sqrt{N-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条保留引理21.3证明中的初始偏差因子，并由 Cauchy–Schwarz 加入显式统计距离界。随机矩阵保持非负性和总质量。由列和为1，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_G\">\\(P_G\\)</span> 保持零和子空间；由均匀平稳性，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_t-u_N=P_G^t(p-u_N)\">\\(p_t-u_N=P_G^t(p-u_N)\\)</span>。定义中的范数界迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 次得到首个不等式。又有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|p-u_N\\|_2^2=\\sum_vp(v)^2-1/N\\le1-1/N\">\\(\\|p-u_N\\|_2^2=\\sum_vp(v)^2-1/N\\le1-1/N\\)</span>；最后用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|z\\|_1\\le\\sqrt N\\|z\\|_2\">\\(\\|z\\|_1\\le\\sqrt N\\|z\\|_2\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>推导对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=0\">\\(t=0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=1\">\\(N=1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=0\">\\(\\lambda=0\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=1\">\\(\\lambda=1\\)</span> 均有效；只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda&lt;1\">\\(\\lambda&lt;1\\)</span> 才由此得到随时间趋零的结论。书中引理给出较粗的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^t\">\\(\\lambda^t\\)</span> 界，后两项是本地完整推论；未据此采用原书引理21.4的度数无关谱隙。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-spectral-expander","status":"resolved","id":"df14955ee1f08cd3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-spectral-expander]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-spectral-expander","status":"resolved","id":"df14955ee1f08cd3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$；$P_G,u_N,\\lambda(G)$ 与范数见 [[28-df-spectral-expander]] 及其上游。$p\\in[0,1]^N$，$\\sum_vp(v)=1$；$t\\in\\mathbb N$。$p_t=P_G^tp$，$P_G^0=I_N$，并约定 $\\lambda(G)^0=1$。所有向量均为 $[N]$ 上的列向量。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}","display":false},{"tex":"P_G,u_N,\\lambda(G)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in[0,1]^N","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_vp(v)=1","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"p_t=P_G^tp","display":false},{"tex":"P_G^0=I_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda(G)^0=1","display":false},{"tex":"[N]","display":false},{"tex":"p_t\\in[0,1]^N,\\qquad\\sum_{v=1}^Np_t(v)=1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\|p_t-u_N\\|_{2,N}\\le\\lambda(G)^t\\|p-u_N\\|_{2,N}\\le\\lambda(G)^t\\sqrt{1-N^{-1}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\frac12\\sum_{v=1}^N|p_t(v)-N^{-1}|\\le\\frac{\\sqrt N}{2}\\lambda(G)^t\\|p-u_N\\|_{2,N}\\le\\frac12\\lambda(G)^t\\sqrt{N-1}.","display":true},{"tex":"P_G","display":false},{"tex":"p_t-u_N=P_G^t(p-u_N)","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\|p-u_N\\|_2^2=\\sum_vp(v)^2-1/N\\le1-1/N","display":false},{"tex":"\\|z\\|_1\\le\\sqrt N\\|z\\|_2","display":false},{"tex":"t=0","display":false},{"tex":"N=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda<1","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^t","display":false}],"bytes":1782,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-264","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第21章：扩展图、游走与提取器：[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]、[[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]、[[28-df-spectral-expander]]、[[28-df-edge-expander]]、[[28-df-explicit-expander-family]]、[[28-thm-random-walk-mixing]]、[[28-thm-expander-mixing-lemma]]、[[28-thm-spectral-implies-edge-expansion]]、[[28-thm-lazy-walk-spectrum]]、[[28-thm-expander-walk-extractor]]。"},{"id":"575e49f7e8ce8f6f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,t\\in\\mathbb N$，$r\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$k\\in[0,n]$；$G=(2^n,2^r,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{2^n,2^r}$ 且 $\\lambda(G)\\le\\alpha<1$，$\\alpha\\ge0$。图、游走和谱界见 [[28-thm-random-walk-mixing]]。$\\operatorname{Extractor}_{n,d,m}$、$\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}$、统计距离 $\\Delta$ 见 [[28-df-randomness-extractor]] 及其上游。字串下标从1开始；$z\\in\\{0,1\\}^{rt}$ 唯一分成长度 $r$ 的块 $z^{(1)},\\ldots,z^{(t)}$。对所有 $j\\in\\mathbb N$ 定义 $b_j$；$\\operatorname{Ext}_{G,t}:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^{rt}\\to\\{0,1\\}^n$ 和 $\\epsilon_{n,k,t}$ 由下式定义；$b_j^{-1}$ 为双射的逆，$\\alpha^0=1$。$X$ 与均匀种子 $U_{rt}$ 独立。"}],"outgoing":["df14955ee1f08cd3"]}